---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

import HeroText from '~/components/widgets/HeroText.astro';
import Content from '~/components/widgets/Content.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Our Story',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <!-- HeroText Widget ******************* -->

  <HeroText tagline="Our Story" title="Our Story" />

  <!-- Content Widget **************** How we began ****** -->

  <Content
    isReversed
    image={{
      src: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543269865-cbf427effbad?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1740&q=80',
      alt: 'Young professionals from different backgrounds in conversation around a table',
    }}
  >
    <Fragment slot="content">
      <p class="mb-4">
        MIA began when a group of us from very different backgrounds came together around the same question: why do
        people so often feel most alone inside the very systems they belong to, precisely when they are trying to
        realise their potential?
      </p>
      <p>
        At first glance, sport and business can look like two separate worlds. But we saw the same human story in both:
        joining a team or an organisation, trying to prove yourself, searching for somewhere you can belong, and finding
        your way through uncertainty. What brought us together was a shared conviction that no one should be left behind
        at a pivotal transition in their life because they were judged "not strong enough."
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  </Content>

  <!-- Content Widget **************** What we believe ****** -->

  <Content
    isAfterContent
    image={{
      src: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523240795612-9a054b0db644?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1740&q=80',
      alt: 'A team working together around a shared purpose',
    }}
  >
    <Fragment slot="content">
      <p class="mb-4">
        We believe that when people are better supported, the systems around them grow stronger too. Teams and
        organisations move forward with people who are more committed, more resilient, more open to collaboration and
        ready to develop. The result is a stronger culture, more sustainable performance, and potential that is not lost
        at critical transitions.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is why MIA means <em>Meaning, Impact, Action</em> to us: bringing meaning to the work we do, creating lasting
        impact, and turning knowledge into concrete steps. In our partnerships with clubs and organisations, we bring our
        different areas of expertise together around a shared purpose. We design systems that support young athletes and professionals
        not only to perform, but to develop, to build a sense of belonging, and to add lasting value to the structures they
        are part of.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  </Content>
</Layout>
